<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's Howard to meet Dalai Lama - aide.</title>
<headline>Australia's Howard to meet Dalai Lama - aide.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard will meet exiled Tibetan spiritual leader the Dalai Lama on Thursday for informal talks, a spokesman for Howard told Reuters on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
